README.md:297:## Release workflow
README.md:321:- Android APK release:
README.md:347:# Normal new personal release:
README.md:348:# 1) Write short functional release notes in the ticket, for example:
README.md:352:pnpm release 1.2.7 -- --release-notes tickets/done/<ticket-name>/release-notes.md
README.md:355:pnpm release:test --ref personal
README.md:359:pnpm release:manual-dispatch v1.2.7 --ref personal
README.md:364:- Do not run `release:manual-dispatch` immediately after a fresh `release` for the same version.
README.md:366:- `release:manual-dispatch` is the manual recovery / re-publish path for an existing tag, not the normal second step of a new release.
README.md:367:- Curated release notes should stay user-facing and functional only; use `.github/release-notes/template.md` as the repo-level format reference.
README.md:370:- `scripts/desktop-release.sh`
